","abstract":[{"text":"Inherited from ","type":"text"},{"code":"View.navigationDocument(_:preview:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","title":"Interaction_DragView","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Interaction_DragView"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-1oxp9":{"title":"navigationDocument(_:preview:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/navigationDocument(_:preview:)-1oxp9","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"navigationDocument"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I2"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"D"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preview"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI12SharePreviewV","text":"SharePreview"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I1"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I2"},{"kind":"text","text":">) -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/navigationdocument(_:preview:)-1oxp9"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","title":"Swami","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}]}}}